{"title":"In die allgemeine Form umrechnen","puid":"c-mat-8/cn3z9w","path":"/../c-mat-8/topic-08-funktionen/block-07-quadratische-funktionen/level-06","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","voice":"f5","textAlign":"left","instruction":{"text":"Rechne die Scheitelform in die allgemeine Form um. Rechne in kleinen Schritten und benutze die binomischen Formeln.","speaker":true,"voice":"m3"},"hint":{"text":"Die ersten beiden binomischen Formeln lauten: <br> <mat>(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2</mat>,<br><mat>(a-b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2</mat>.","style":"avatar"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"gap","gapMode":"write","gapValidateMode":"value","shuffleAtoms":true,"atoms":[{"a":"<mat>f(x) = 2(x-3)^2+1</mat>","b":"<mat>f(x) = 2(<gap>x^2-6x+9</gap>) + 1</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>2x^2-12x+18</gap> + 1</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>2x^2-12x+19</gap></mat>"},{"a":"<mat>f(x) = 1/2 (4-x)^2 - 5</mat>","b":"<mat>f(x) = 1/2 (<gap>16-8x+x^2</gap>) - 5</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>8-4x+1/2x^2</gap> - 5</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>3-4x+1/2x^2</gap></mat>"},{"a":"<mat>f(x) = 5(x+2)^2-9</mat>","b":"<mat>f(x) = 5(<gap>x^2+4x+4</gap>)-9</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>5x^2+20x+20</gap>-9</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>5x^2+20x+11</gap></mat>"},{"a":"<mat>f(x) = 0.1(10+x)^2+15</mat>","b":"<mat>f(x) = 0.1(<gap>100+20x+x^2</gap>)+15</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>10+2x+0.1x^2</gap>+15</mat><br><mat>f(x) = <gap>0.1x^2+2x+25</gap></mat>"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Funktionen","path":"/../c-mat-8/topic-08-funktionen/topic","puid":"c-mat-8/3j3xaa"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Quadratische Funktionen","path":"/../c-mat-8/topic-08-funktionen/block-07-quadratische-funktionen/block","puid":"c-mat-8/348hai"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/Rechne die Scheitelform in die allgemeine Form um. Rechne in kleinen Schritten und benutze die binomischen Formeln.","etag":"11a2-30822"}],"svgs":[],"lsgs":[],"images":[]},"etag":"f3e0-1889"}